REFERENCE           SPEEDRUN_DESC
LANG_ENGLISH        "^5Speedrun: ^7Complete maps as fast as possible and compete for the top spot\non the leaderboard. Getting a time on the leaderboard will give you XP depending on how high up\nyour time is and how many times have already been set\n^5Modes: ^7Switch game modes using the game commands: ^8!190 !210 !defrag !portal !bhop\n^5Commands: ^7Type ^8!help ^7in chat to see all available commands\n^5Demos: ^7Watch the current map world record replay directly from the leaderboard menu\n^5IW3SR: ^7A custom client with extra features, improvements and a built-in video player\n^5GitHub: ^7SR is open source and can be found at: ^8https://github.com/Iswenzz\n^5Discord: ^7Join us for updates, help and community: ^8https://discord.gg/76aHfGF"

REFERENCE           DEATHRUN_DESC
LANG_ENGLISH        "^5Deathrun: ^7The classical mod in which a single player fights alone against the other team,\nhis only weapons are his deadly traps. The players in the opposite team have to kill the activator\nafter finishing his course without dying\n^5Commands: ^7Type ^8!help ^7in chat to see all available commands\n^5IW3SR: ^7A custom client with extra features, improvements and a built-in video player\n^5GitHub: ^7SR is open source and can be found at: ^8https://github.com/Iswenzz\n^5Discord: ^7Join us for updates, help and community: ^8https://discord.gg/76aHfGF"

REFERENCE           BATTLEROYALE_DESC
LANG_ENGLISH        "^5BattleRoyale: ^7The popular battle royale gamemode from other games such as \nPlayer Unknown's Battlegrounds, Fortnite, H1Z1, recreated on Call of Duty 4!\n^5Commands: ^7Type ^8!help ^7in chat to see all available commands\n^5IW3SR: ^7A custom client with extra features, improvements and a built-in video player\n^5GitHub: ^7SR is open source and can be found at: ^8https://github.com/Iswenzz\n^5Discord: ^7Join us for updates, help and community: ^8https://discord.gg/76aHfGF"

